Let $|Z|=|\mathrm{W}|=r$
\Rightarrow Z=r e^{i $\theta$}, $\mathrm{W}=$r e^{i \phi}

where $\theta+\phi=\pi$
\therefore \quad \bar{W}=r e^{-i \phi}

Now, $Z=r e^{i(\pi-\phi)}=r e^{i \pi} \times e^{-i \phi}=-r e^{-i \phi}$
=-\bar{W}

Thus, statement-1 is true but statement- 2 is false.

