Given $|z-4| \lt  |z-2|$ Let $z=x+$ iy

\begin{aligned}
& \Rightarrow \mid(x-4)+i y)| < |(x-2)+i y \mid \Rightarrow(x-4)^2+y^2 < (x-2)^2+y^2 \\
& \Rightarrow x^2-8 x+16 < x^2-4 x+4 \Rightarrow 12 < 4 x \Rightarrow x>3 \Rightarrow $\operatorname{Re}$(z)>3
\end{aligned}

